  Occupation: Student
  CharacterDescription: Sharp, jittery, and hyper-observant. She notices small details the player might miss. Her arc shifts from high-alert survivalism to a frantic, wide-eyed obsession with "patterns" in the decay.
  CharacterArc: Sharp and hyper-observant, Gvantsa was the kind of student who noticed everything and said very little. As the radiation set in she shifted from careful observer to frantic archivist, cataloguing every flicker and grey smear of the world's decay as though finding the pattern would save her from it. By the end she has catalogued so much that she can no longer tell the signal from the noise.
